  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "**Professionally managed by Coast Property Management**<br><br>Welcome to “Blessings By the Sea” – our renovated 4-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom home in WaterColor.<br><br>LOCATION:<br><br>Located in the Crossing District of WaterColor - one of the most highly sought-after communities along Scenic Highway 30A<br>On a quiet street just around the corner from the Dragonfly Pool<br>4-minute golf cart ride or 5-minute bike ride to the WaterColor Beach Club<br>Minutes from the town centers of WaterColor and Seaside featuring restaurants, shopping, and family activities<br><br>PROPERTY OVERVIEW:<br><br>1st Floor:<br>Open concept kitchen, dining, and living area<br>Dining table seating for eight with an additional four seats at the large kitchen island<br>Gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br>Spacious screened-in porch with seating<br>Bedroom 1: Primary owner suite: King bed + fully-renovated bathroom (walk-in shower, double vanity)<br>Office nook<br>Fully-renovated powder room<br>Laundry room<br><br>2nd Floor:<br>Living area with flat-screen TV<br>Bedroom 2: Secondary owner suite: King bed + twin bed with trundle (sleeps up to 4), flat-screen TV, and private balcony with porch swing. Fully-renovated bathroom (walk-in shower)<br>Bedroom 3: King bed with fully-renovated bathroom (walk-in shower, double vanity)<br>Bedroom 4: Bunk room: Custom twin beds (x2)<br>Fully remodeled hallway bathroom (shower/tub combo)<br><br>AMENITIES:<br><br>6-Seater Golf Cart included with rental<br>Access to WaterColor Beach Club (amenity passes for up to 10 guests)<br>Access to all six heated WaterColor pools<br>Private 2nd floor balcony with porch swing<br>Outdoor shower<br>Coffee makers: Keurig + standard drip<br>Community green space directly behind home<br><br>To enhance your stay, we also provide a starter supply of premium, eco-friendly guest essentials, including:<br><br>🧴 Body Wash, Shampoo & Conditioner<br>🧼 Hand Soap, Dish Soap & Dishwasher Pods<br>🧻 Toilet Paper, Paper Towels & Facial Tissues<br>🗑️ Trash Bags & Dish Sponge<br>🧺 Laundry Detergent<br><br>GUEST SUPPORT:<br><br>Need assistance? Coast's dedicated management team is available to help with anything you need—just give us a call!<br><br>IMPORTANT NOTES:<br><br>🔞 Age Requirement: The primary guest must be 25 or older to book.<br>🚗 Parking: The home comes with driveway parking for a car, as well as community parking permits.<br>🕐 Check-In Policy: Please do not arrive before your scheduled check-in time.<br>🚫 No Pets & No Smoking: This home has a strict no-pet policy. Unauthorized pets will result in immediate eviction and loss of rental fees, with the guest responsible for any damages. The home is also strictly non-smoking.",
